<title>USA: Arlington Cty, Va. won by Lehman Brothers.</title>
<headline>Arlington Cty, Va. won by Lehman Brothers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it won $34.2 million of Arlington County, Va., general obligation public improvement bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.0178 percent.</p>
</text>
